\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Core artifact-aware evidence at density 0.15. (a) Cost and route completion separate stationary cost reduction from progress-preserving behavior. (b) The progress-safety frontier separates PPO backbone, Risk-only, reward-only control, and runtime intervention. (c) Low-progress rate exposes the non-motion artifact. (d) Two step-level diagnostics are reported on a common 0--100 scale: TTC-danger percentage and interventions per 100 control steps.}}{12}{figure.44}\protected@file@percent }
